  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableNote
  text: 'Day 12 down here.

    So cold the candles barely burn.

    Ray went up the stairs to look on Tuesday.

    His jacket and his shoes are still at the top.

    Nobody takes their shoes off in this cold.'
